    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Take a deep dive into the world of Four Dimensions! Whether you are interested in the shapes, or want to become a master of <i>4D Chess</i>, or fancy getting lost in a <i>4D Maze</i>, <strong><i>4D Games</i></strong> is full of challenges, colour and confusion!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264190/extras/f1e2b33df077c8e8eb6d6ddea15085cb.avif?t=1719399726\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Shape Games &amp; The Playground Modes</h2><br><strong><i>4D Games</i></strong> includes dozens of shapes for you to play around with through the view of a <i>3D Cross Section</i>, as well as a series of games that challenge you and your understanding of how these shapes behave!<br><br>Make sure to check out the <i>Playground</i> modes too, to really identify the quirks of each shape!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4D Chess</h2><br>How many moves ahead can you keep track of across the 256 squares spanning the Four Dimensions? Challenge your friends locally or through <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong> to see who really is the master at <i>4D Chess</i>!<br><br>There are 3 board layouts for you to try on a 4x4x4x4 Chess Board. Check out the <strong>Steam Workshop</strong> to install other players custom board layouts or even create your own!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4D Maze</h2><br>Fancy a more relaxed game? Take your time gliding along the paths of a <i>4D Maze</i>! The Mazes are procedurally generated and come in sizes from 3x3x3x3 to 8x8x8x8. It gets pretty hard pretty quickly!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4D Shape Editor</h2><br>Want to take your abilities with 4D Shapes to the next level? <strong><i>4D Games</i></strong> includes a Node based <i>Shader Editor</i> that allows you to create totally custom 4D Shapes using <i>Ray Marching</i>. Combine and manipulate shapes, and don't forget to browse the <strong>Workshop</strong> to see what other players have been getting up to!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264190/extras/335c433227200ba71e390fa00e798297.poster.avif?t=1719399726\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264190/extras/335c433227200ba71e390fa00e798297.webm?t=1719399726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Take a deep dive into the world of Four Dimensions! Whether you are interested in the shapes, or want to become a master of <i>4D Chess</i>, or fancy getting lost in a <i>4D Maze</i>, <strong><i>4D Games</i></strong> is full of challenges, colour and confusion!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264190/extras/f1e2b33df077c8e8eb6d6ddea15085cb.avif?t=1719399726\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Shape Games &amp; The Playground Modes</h2><br><strong><i>4D Games</i></strong> includes dozens of shapes for you to play around with through the view of a <i>3D Cross Section</i>, as well as a series of games that challenge you and your understanding of how these shapes behave!<br><br>Make sure to check out the <i>Playground</i> modes too, to really identify the quirks of each shape!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4D Chess</h2><br>How many moves ahead can you keep track of across the 256 squares spanning the Four Dimensions? Challenge your friends locally or through <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong> to see who really is the master at <i>4D Chess</i>!<br><br>There are 3 board layouts for you to try on a 4x4x4x4 Chess Board. Check out the <strong>Steam Workshop</strong> to install other players custom board layouts or even create your own!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4D Maze</h2><br>Fancy a more relaxed game? Take your time gliding along the paths of a <i>4D Maze</i>! The Mazes are procedurally generated and come in sizes from 3x3x3x3 to 8x8x8x8. It gets pretty hard pretty quickly!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4D Shape Editor</h2><br>Want to take your abilities with 4D Shapes to the next level? <strong><i>4D Games</i></strong> includes a Node based <i>Shader Editor</i> that allows you to create totally custom 4D Shapes using <i>Ray Marching</i>. Combine and manipulate shapes, and don't forget to browse the <strong>Workshop</strong> to see what other players have been getting up to!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264190/extras/335c433227200ba71e390fa00e798297.poster.avif?t=1719399726\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264190/extras/335c433227200ba71e390fa00e798297.webm?t=1719399726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
